From 5b2c70a2d907f53bd12927b875c345f5a23baf17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:07:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 43/43] Polycrystal: secant acceleration of the fixed point on
 the lateral stresses

Option --macroscopic-secant-acceleration: the lateral components of the
macroscopic displacement gradient are corrected with an estimate of the
jacobian of the lateral stresses, initialized by the macroscopic elastic
stiffness and updated by the method of Broyden after each resolution,
instead of the macroscopic elastic compliance, with which the residual is
only divided by about 2 per iteration once the material flows.
---
